shape: sequence_diagram
source: Synthetic EventSource
adapter: Canonical adapter
engine: MatchProcessor
detector: Tactical detector
ui: Live overlay
orchestrator: Agent orchestrator
foundry: Foundry agents
verifier: Deterministic verifier

source -> adapter: match event at replay timestamp
adapter -> engine: validated MatchEvent
engine -> detector: updated state
detector -> ui: verified tactical insight + evidence IDs
detector -> orchestrator: valuable insight candidate (async, planned)
orchestrator -> foundry: evidence-only tools + audience profile
foundry -> verifier: structured narrative with references
verifier -> ui: accepted personalized overlay (planned)
verifier -> orchestrator: invalid claim / fail-closed (planned)
